Someone asked for mail sent to <%= @mailbox.address %> to be forwarded to <%= @mailbox.forward_to %>. Nothing will be forwarded until that is confirmed here:

<%= domain_mailbox_forwarding_confirmation_url(@mailbox.domain, @mailbox, script_name: @mailbox.account.slug, forwarding_token: @token) %>

This link will work for 24 hours. Nothing will be forwarded to <%= @mailbox.forward_to %> unless it's used, so you can ignore this email.
